exit: 1
-- SYNTAX -------------------- errors/parse_error_6.march

A file may have only one top-level `mod`; everything else must live inside it. [parse_error]

8 | mod R10SecondTopLevelModSecond do
    ^^^

    mod Name do
        fn helper() do ... end
        fn main() do ... end
    end
    After this is fixed, `main` will also need permission to print: add `needs IO.Console` to the module, and ask for it in `main`, `fn main() needs IO.Console do`.
    run `march --explain parse_error`
